  "details": "I would love to see, if the VrChat team would more openly communicate on what they are doing behind their closed curtains and share more their plans and current doings for the future of the game.\nIt is always sad to see if when there is no communication, only hard announcements without any regard for the voices of the community, where you feel left alone even though a feature request gets traction but never a response back.\nA more open policy on communication with the community would be wishful to make a true social and community centered game.",
